 **Inputs:**
-*   Ray origin $\mathbf{o}$ (3D vector).
-*   Ray direction $\mathbf{d}$ (unit-norm 3D vector).
-*   Near clipping plane distance $t_{near}$ (scalar).
-*   Far clipping plane distance $t_{far}$ (scalar).
-*   Number of samples $N$ (integer).
